Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:51:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/18] Add one-time contextual hints

HintEngine shows each tip once (remembered between sessions) with a
cooldown. Tips cover the pulse, the beacon crystal, drifting stones, the
lift, the camera, and a 'stuck' tip after three falls at one checkpoint.
